    {
      "id": "10cc1d67-821a-405f-8575-78f994ec7fdb",
      "title": "Escute a nova frase e compare com a forma feminina que você acabou de ver.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "fdc4d390-6361-4551-aae2-bc0dd231b425",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora um homem fala de si.</p><p><strong>Soy brasileño.</strong></p><p>Sou brasileiro.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/abeb6fbb2331452b8a91e8f43b3d5c53_b04-soy-brasileno.mp3?Expires=1794099395&Signature=WnAQ4mtwoxCzg6axuJd0rlz~x~BU23x0OotoJUg2tCOM6zO29qXpsjOOns0FnEt2ms8tTHRxxE70mrrLyCdv3Vj0FCPeuqowTRnY9hlpau-dw4isTeVWop4GwQ-qJbCMkJF1SbPgLfSxehFkrKFmUEDx7yZ27l-BH15dl28U3yCqkAibBfUHNT0bufzUz4XjuE4lCNW9PXBnnDsBCz28iG-VWPEAz5Lbv-L21KkGk-wSppYyWqwoP48hNXwfkg29n72a~tvVLhziGresaYiwWqGLZsdlmd7AAREHyYAZtg23nJ2sFYownFG4exAVxqM-JQCRgo1rYE5c407KkL7Tnw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f3e07c8e-75e5-41c5-951a-bcedfa3129d2",
      "title": "Observe o que continua igual e o que muda quando quem fala é homem.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c61bdbb9-9ada-47ca-b128-6fe37abf375b",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>soy</strong> continua igual.</p><p><strong>brasileño</strong> é a forma usada quando quem fala é homem.</p><p>A ideia principal não muda: a frase continua servindo para dizer a nacionalidade de forma direta.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c0a2fb0f-e01f-4075-8b54-68137f65488f",
      "title": "Passe pelos cartões e compare o que fica igual e o que muda de um exemplo para o outro.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1185cdbc-3ebc-4c0e-82e0-f0b5a273100b",
          "textContent": "<p>Exemplo A</p><p><strong>Me llamo Laura. Soy brasileña.</strong></p><p>A forma feminina termina em <strong>-a</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6f652f7a992b4fdc94dc3a2f0d072a3a_b06-me-llamo-laura-soy-brasilena.mp3?Expires=1794099395&Signature=QqPjofUcySFmUN8NFy~Q4535x6Fol9h06K79~FcWat4xYV8IYIrClB6JmmMy9usZeKINW9EdTPIHDErOmeqNOL0E~AoURliUeWryOVUUMN4IAs9bhpRHlYighMFxYwNSBzAwc3DJPpeOv-9UKEp4~AbtpJlx2~j-ro5NDV-NFpvJs0KKghb0ciAdJrXAXJdljmOOd8nnD~hquSSzTTXRtUkUoC5XpCBj~oiBAK6fJYQlwSj7QQwzlxwhH8HGrQHuF2Ve0VnFtPB~nKZNqI44T8R4azVsM27RQxQQ-CSe5G8eekGo2L7fOK1dwTuEnQR3U0AoUKshfVti4ADEuUja1g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "a3b529f4-ed04-4eca-bd3f-1c089a1792aa",
          "textContent": "<p>Exemplo B</p><p><strong>Me llamo Bruno. Soy brasileño.</strong></p><p>A forma masculina termina em <strong>-o</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b493b604fcac459581ce085dfd02ee89_b06-me-llamo-bruno-soy-brasileno.mp3?Expires=1794099395&Signature=JBxmYcfyFDXQmP21VM6~s3aJ-TMsYss4iapdLLFeBDfNn2gLuSi-Xq6mwcN79Edc~g9XfKSkYxQ93X2LtydYX~u~UmsRU2o9CgBxhDfd4ts~kPbNl7-9xFk7hpi9LRCv3IdCMnxbF7~QJxGm5dh7-09xkahWIbSv1m7ZbYAzQRZahzI3uX8GeL~YkaQaveI3h4pmiWVkcAgV9H4SbdyZc2yO4g8yOoexa62NviWD2AkTTnQHNItO~8g3S5NjaETxccSmzqEFtf6PZG8nQbscfRWnlY~4wHvOqZXsNtku6bjkdvcanarfTUl14m7nqHOpzD2-1dGwqvFXH1N6el7Z8w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "74204f83-f387-4905-b863-491f45af41f9",
          "textContent": "<p>Compare os dois exemplos.</p><p><strong>soy</strong> continua igual.</p><p>A parte que muda é a nacionalidade: <strong>brasileña</strong> / <strong>brasileño</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a4a9e549-81c7-4956-afb2-7332d96bfb3b",
      "title": "Observe a escrita das palavras e note como elas aparecem na frase completa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "badaa5fa-16c6-4391-91a6-010f764803ce",
          "textContent": "<p>Em espanhol, nacionalidades aparecem com letra minúscula.</p><ul><li><strong>Soy brasileña.</strong></li><li><strong>Soy brasileño.</strong></li></ul><p>Escreva <strong>brasileña</strong> e <strong>brasileño</strong>, não <strong>Brasileña</strong> ou <strong>Brasileño</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
